Initializes an \code{RSNABoolean} object that wraps an \code{NA} logical value.
This class represents the NA counterpart to \code{RSBoolean}, and should be used
whenever a logical \code{NA} is required within the scalar object framework.
Internally, it delegates to \code{RSBoolean$initialize(NA)} and returns the object invisibly.
